--- !u!114 &2089370806244153020
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7866442855936196245}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 71d9fded1f0d50649aad7d117a4cda32, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BliDialogueTrigger
  start:
    name: Bli
    sentences:
    - Oh, hello. So, you're Mika? I've heard some things... Not sure what to make
      of you
    - Go have a look around. Some of the locals could use help.
    - See that button on the top left? Make sure that's checked when you're jumping
      from planet to planet.
    - Oh, and if you ever get lost in space, press R. It'll snap you right back here.
      You can only do it a few times though!
    - Well, go on. Come back when you're done helping around.
  ongoing:
    name: Bli
    sentences:
    - Some people still need your help. Come back later.
  finalQuest:
    name: Bli
    sentences:
    - You did good. Thanks for helping out.
    - See that thing orbiting up there? That's my mini-moon. Been up there a while.
    - If you can catch it its yours. A thank you from all of us. Good luck.
  complete:
    name: Bli
    sentences:
    - Wow, did you eat it already? Okay.
    - Nothing else for you here now. You can get going by getting on that platform
      over there.
    - Goodbye.
